// Title: fire stream definition (KScript), consolidating the fire streams of a bubble's buttons
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Section 1 (KSWorld bubble example), code listing
//         after "Each of the buttons has a stream called fire"; PDF page 10 (printed page 9).
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.
fire <- anyE(contents,
"fire")

// Transcription notes
// - The printed listing is wrapped onto two lines in a narrow column: "fire <- anyE(contents," then
//   "\"fire\")". The line break is from the printed column width; kept as printed.
// - The text layer and the page image agree on both lines.
// - Indentation: the second line starts at column 0 as printed in the narrow block.
